---
/** Roboto Slab and Xmind in the weights in use, Xmind italic, and Greek in running prose. */

const SLAB_WEIGHTS = [500, 800]
const XMIND_WEIGHTS = [400, 600, 800]
const XMIND_ITALIC_WEIGHTS = [400, 600]
const MATHS_SYMBOLS = '≈ ≠ ≤ ≥ ± × ÷ − → ← ∞ ∂ ∇ ∑ ∫ √ ∝ ° ′ ″'
---

<h3>Roboto Slab</h3>
{
  SLAB_WEIGHTS.map((weight) => (
    <p class="slab" style={`font-weight: ${weight}`}>
      <span class="label">{weight}</span>
      Sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow
    </p>
  ))
}

<h3>Xmind</h3>
{
  XMIND_WEIGHTS.map((weight) => (
    <p class="xmind" style={`font-weight: ${weight}`}>
      <span class="label">{weight}</span>
      Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs. 0123456789
    </p>
  ))
}
{
  XMIND_ITALIC_WEIGHTS.map((weight) => (
    <p class="xmind" style={`font-weight: ${weight}; font-style: italic`}>
      <span class="label">{weight} italic</span>
      The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
    </p>
  ))
}

<h3>Greek in prose</h3>
<p class="slab greek-heading">Δt, σ and β in a heading: Ξεσκεπάζω</p>
<p class="greek-prose">
  With σ = 10, ρ = 28 and β ≈ 0.3, halving the step Δt leaves the trajectory unchanged to within
  ε. <em>Ξεσκεπάζω την ψυχοφθόρα βδελυγμία.</em> Η γρήγορη καφέ αλεπού πηδάει πάνω από τον τεμπέλη
  σκύλο, and the sentence carries on in Latin script.
</p>

<h3>Maths symbols</h3>
<p class="slab symbols">{MATHS_SYMBOLS}</p>
<p class="xmind symbols">{MATHS_SYMBOLS}</p>
<p class="xmind symbols"><em>{MATHS_SYMBOLS}</em></p>
<p class="label">Symbols a family lacks fall back to the system font.</p>

<style>
  h3 {
    margin-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  p {
    margin-block: 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  .label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .slab {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    line-height: var(--line-height-heading);
  }

  .xmind {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .greek-heading {
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .greek-prose {
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .symbols {
    word-spacing: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
